{"resourceIdentifier":"4478","resourceName":"Municipal Solid Waste Treatment by Composting in Ghaziabad Nagar Nigam","description":"The project activity is a grouped project activity promoted by Nagar Nigam Ghaziabad (hereinafter also called as “NNG”). As number of existing solid waste disposal near metros and urban/semi urban cities in host country, NNG envisage to promotes the waste treatment using alternate method that is composting. NNG envisage to contribute towards sustainable development and helping to meet the host country targets to increase MSW treatment penetration level. The project instances under the grouped project will be located in Ghaziabad Nagar Nigam, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh, India.\r\n\r\nThe NNG has planned to establish composting facilities in various location within Nigam, the 4 composting plant already commissioned with installed capacity 735TPD and rest are under commissioning.","location":{"latitude":28.667856,"longitude":77.449791},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-10-05","endExclusive":"2023-11-05","endInclusive":"2023-11-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4478"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"38693"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"23/06/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string",